  <entity00356361:DescriptionOfValuationProcessesUsedInFairValueMeasurementOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueOfFinancialLiabilitiesTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_MeasurementAxis_ifrs-full_AtFairValueMember" xml:lang="ko">장부금액이 공정가치의 합리적인 근사치이므로 공정가치 공시에서 제외하였습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionOfValuationProcessesUsedInFairValueMeasurementOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfBookValueAndFairValueOfFinancialLiabilitiesTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofborrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00356361_BankborrowingsMemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_entity00356361_ForeignCurrencyMemberOfFunctionalOrPresentationCurrencyMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00356361_JpMorganAndOthersMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">전기 중 제너럴모터스(GM)가 연결회사의 미국 에너지부(DOE) 정책자금 차입금을 상환하였고, 당반기말 현재 제너럴모터스(GM) 관련 차입금 잔액은 1.3조원으로 최종 만기는 2030년 4월 30일입니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofborrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofborrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00356361_BankborrowingsMemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_entity00356361_FunctionalcurrencyMemberOfFunctionalOrPresentationCurrencyMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00356361_KoreaDevelopmentBankAndTheOtherMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">KDB산업은행 일부 차입금에 대해서는 연결회사의 건물 등이 근저당 설정되어 있습니다(주석 11 참조).</entity00356361:DescriptionofborrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofborrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00356361_BankborrowingsMemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_entity00356361_ForeignCurrencyMemberOfFunctionalOrPresentationCurrencyMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00356361_JpMorganAndOthersMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">전기 중 제너럴모터스(GM)가 연결회사의 미국 에너지부(DOE) 정책자금 차입금을 상환하였습니다.
전기말 현재 신디케이션론(ANZ/HSBC/JPM 등) 및 EIB의 장기차입 관련하여 연결회사는 약정에 따라 차입금이 전액 상환될 때까지 연결 재무비율의 유지(총 차입금/EBITDA 4배 미만) 등의 제약을 받으며 해당 차입 약정에 대한 재무약정을 미충족하여 장기차입금을 유동부채로 분류하였습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofborrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofborrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00356361_BankborrowingsMemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_entity00356361_FunctionalcurrencyMemberOfFunctionalOrPresentationCurrencyMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00356361_KoreaDevelopmentBankAndTheOtherMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">KDB산업은행 일부 차입금에 대해서는 연결회사의 건물 등이 근저당 설정되어 있습니다(주석 11 참조).</entity00356361:DescriptionofborrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingsTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialassetofdisclosureoffinancialassetslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialassetsbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_dart_OtherFinancialAssetsMember" xml:lang="ko">(*2) 기타금융자산은 범주별 금융자산의 적용을 받지 않는 파생상품자산을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialassetofdisclosureoffinancialassetslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialassetsbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialassetofdisclosureoffinancialassetslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialassetsbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_ifrs-full_FinancialAssetsMeasuredAtFairValueThroughOtherComprehensiveIncomeCategoryMember" xml:lang="ko">(*1) 연결회사는 단기매매항목이 아닌 전략적 투자목적으로 보유하는 지분상품에 대해 최초적용일에 기타포괄손익-공정가치 측정항목으로 지정하는 취소불가능한 선택권을 적용하였습니다. 또한, 연결회사는 현금흐름 수취 및 매도목적으로 보유하고 있는 매출채권을 기타포괄손익-공정가치 측정 금융자산으로 분류하였습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialassetofdisclosureoffinancialassetslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialassetsbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialassetofdisclosureoffinancialassetslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialassetsbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_dart_OtherFinancialAssetsMember" xml:lang="ko">(*2) 기타금융자산은 범주별 금융자산의 적용을 받지 않는 파생상품자산을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialassetofdisclosureoffinancialassetslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialassetsbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialassetofdisclosureoffinancialassetslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialassetsbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_ifrs-full_FinancialAssetsMeasuredAtFairValueThroughOtherComprehensiveIncomeCategoryMember" xml:lang="ko">(*1) 연결회사는 단기매매항목이 아닌 전략적 투자목적으로 보유하는 지분상품에 대해 최초적용일에 기타포괄손익-공정가치 측정항목으로 지정하는 취소불가능한 선택권을 적용하였습니다. 또한, 연결회사는 현금흐름 수취 및 매도목적으로 보유하고 있는 매출채권을 기타포괄손익-공정가치 측정 금융자산으로 분류하였습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialassetofdisclosureoffinancialassetslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialassetsbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialAssetsByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialLiabilitiesAxis_dart_OtherFinancialLiabilitiesMember" xml:lang="ko">(*3) 기타금융부채는 범주별 금융부채의 적용을 받지 않는 리스부채, 파생상품부채 및 네고차입금 등을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialLiabilitiesAxis_dart_OtherFinancialLiabilitiesMember" xml:lang="ko">(*1) 기타금융부채는 범주별 금융부채의 적용을 받지 않는 리스부채 및 금융보증계약부채 등을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialLiabilitiesAxis_dart_OtherFinancialLiabilitiesMember" xml:lang="ko">(*3) 기타금융부채는 범주별 금융부채의 적용을 받지 않는 리스부채, 파생상품부채 및 네고차입금 등을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialLiabilitiesAxis_dart_OtherFinancialLiabilitiesMember" xml:lang="ko">(*3) 기타금융부채는 범주별 금융부채의 적용을 받지 않는 리스부채, 파생상품부채 및 네고차입금 등을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfFinancialLiabilitiesAxis_dart_OtherFinancialLiabilitiesMember" xml:lang="ko">(*1) 기타금융부채는 범주별 금융부채의 적용을 받지 않는 리스부채 및 금융보증계약부채 등을 포함하고 있습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionofnatureoffinancialliabilitiesofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitieslineitemsofdisclosureoffinancialliabilitiesbycategorytableofitemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesLineItemsOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesByCategoryTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DisclosureOfActuarialAssumptionTableOfDisclosureofactuarialassumptionLineItemsOfDisclosureofactuarialassumptionTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_BottomOfRangeMember" xml:lang="ko">전기 중 연결회사는 보다 합리적인 확정급여채무의 산정을 위하여 예측단위적립방식에 대한 보험수리적 가정 중 할인율 산정방식을 변경하였습니다. 이러한 회계 추정의 변경 영향으로 인하여 확정급여채무는 103,884백만원 감소하였으며, 이익잉여금은 103,884백만원(법인세효과 차감 전) 증가하였습니다.</entity00356361:DisclosureOfActuarialAssumptionTableOfDisclosureofactuarialassumptionLineItemsOfDisclosureofactuarialassumptionTableOfItems>
