  <entity00356361:NotesRegardingExchangableBondOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountLineItemsOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00356361_Tranche1MemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 전기 중 해당 사채의 일부를 837,985백만원에 재매입 하였으며, 재매입 시점의 장부가액은 811,249백만원(총 장부가액 1,323,192백만원) 입니다. 재매입 금액과 장부가액의 차이 26,736백만원은 금융비용으로 인식되었습니다.</entity00356361:NotesRegardingExchangableBondOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountLineItemsOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:NotesRegardingExchangableBondOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountLineItemsOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00356361_Tranche3MemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">전기 중 투자자의 교환권 행사로 인해 USD 600,000에 해당하는 2,475주가 교환되었습니다.</entity00356361:NotesRegardingExchangableBondOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountLineItemsOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsAmountTableOfItems>
