  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfBenefitsProvidedByPlan contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_NetDefinedBenefitLiabilityAssetAxis_ifrs-full_PlanAssetsMember" xml:lang="ko">당반기중 확정기여제도로 전환한 임직원에게 지급된 금액은 187,589백만원(전기 : 159,202백만원)입니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfBenefitsProvidedByPlan>
